WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Oh my god, the blood that melted turned into ice again.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,800
Weeping the whole house till death

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,480
Lin Xianzhi, how did you get this brain?

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,800
Dad, don’t you think so?

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,320
It's getting warmer in this room

6
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:15,020
I'm almost sweating. It's so warm.

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,300
This time yesterday

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,780
I thought I was going to freeze to death in the snow, but I didn’t expect it.

9
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,340
Didn't expect tonight

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,780
Can I be in this snow nest?

11
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:26,600
Nuannuan took a breath. It's so cold outside.

12
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,240
It's so warm inside the igloo

13
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,120
Brother Makawa, this is amazing

14
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,040
Lin Xianzhi is really yours

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,120
This igloo lives in

16
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,240
It's actually warmer than our previous house

17
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,800
It's just that the fire is a little too low

18
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,200
I'll add two more firewood

19
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,080
To make it more vigorous and fresh, don’t add more.

20
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:46,360
This house is really going to collapse. Why?

21
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,560
Didn't I just say

22
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:50,560
Will the house be stronger if it's lit by fire? That's a small fire

23
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:54,030
Small fire, slow to melt blood, fast to freeze

24
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:55,810
The little water that melted out

25
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:58,530
There's still time to stay along the wall and freeze it

26
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,220
So the more the house burns, the better it becomes
